&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring a driven and consultative Mid-Market Account Executive to help accelerate Lattice’s next phase of growth. This is an opportunity for ambitious sales professionals who thrive in fast-paced environments, excel at managing complex sales cycles, and are energised by building strong customer relationships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Lattice, sales goes beyond merely pitching a vision or closing deals; it’s about crafting exceptional experiences and building meaningful partnerships with our customers. As an Account Executive, you’ll become a trusted advisor to HR and business leaders by developing deep expertise in the Lattice Talent Suite and broader trends across People Strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who brings strong outbound discipline, operates with urgency and ownership, and enjoys navigating multi-stakeholder buying processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the full sales cycle from prospecting through close for Mid-Market organisations, delivering a high-quality customer experience throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consistently meet or exceed monthly and quarterly new business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate pipeline through proactive outbound prospecting, which represents a critical driver of success in the role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain a healthy, disciplined pipeline through strong follow-up, deal management, and forecasting hygiene.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead thoughtful discovery conversations to uncover business-level challenges and goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Navigate multiple stakeholders and buying groups throughout the sales process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position Lattice’s solutions through a consultative sales approach tailored to each customer’s needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a strong understanding of the HR technology landscape, industry trends, and Lattice’s competitive positioning to guide customers through the buying process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Account Managers to identify expansion opportunities within existing customer accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute positively to team culture through collaboration, curiosity, accountability, and an eagerness to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record in generating new business and surpassing sales and pipeline generation targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of full-cycle SaaS closing experience in a quota-carrying role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing multi-stakeholder sales cycles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional verbal and written communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high sense of ownership and accountability; you proactively manage your business and don&#39;t require close oversight to maintain momentum.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An experimental mindset and eagerness to leverage AI and modern sales tools to work smarter, move faster, and improve execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High coachability, intellectual curiosity, and a genuine desire to continually hone your craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for Lattice’s mission and alignment with our values: Ship Shipmate Self, Clear Eyes, Own the Outcome, and What’s Next?&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re a proactive, results-driven sales professional ready to make a significant impact, we’d love to hear from you. Join us and be part of a team that’s redefining the future of sales and customer experience at Lattice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;___&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The estimated annual cash salary for this role is £69,500 - £81,750. This position is also eligible for incentive stock options, subject to the terms of Lattice’s applicable plans.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This position is also eligible for variable compensation of £69,500 - £81,750, subject to personal performance, company performance, and the terms of Lattice’s applicable plans.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Benefits: The Company offers the following benefits for this position, subject to applicable eligibility requirements: Medical insurance; Dental insurance; Vision insurance; Life, AD&amp;amp;D, and Disability Insurance; Emergency Weather Support; Wellness Apps; Paid Parental Leave, Paid Time off inclusive of holidays and sick time; Commuter &amp;amp; Parking Accounts; Lunches in the Office; Workplace Amenities Stipend, Internet and Phone Stipend; One time WFH Office Set-Up Stipend; 401(k) retirement plan; Financial Planning; Learning &amp;amp; Development Budget&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;*Note on Pay Transparency:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Lattice provides an estimate of the compensation for roles that may be hired as required by state regulations. Compensation may vary based on (a) location, as Lattice factors in specific location when benchmarking compensation for most roles; (b) individual candidate skills and qualifications; and (c) individual candidate experience.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Additionally, Lattice leverages current market data to determine compensation, so posted compensation figures are subject to change as new market data becomes available. The salary, other compensation, and benefits information is accurate as of the date of this posting. Lattice reserves the right to modify this information at any time, subject to applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Lattice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lattice is on a mission to build cultures where employees and their companies thrive. In an age where employees have more choices than ever before, businesses that put employees first are winning 🏅– and Lattice is building the tools to empower those people-centric companies. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lattice is a people success platform that offers performance reviews, employee engagement surveys, real-time feedback, weekly check-ins, goal setting, and career planning in a way that allows companies to focus on employee development, growth, and engagement – yielding stronger employee retention, performance, and impact to the bottom line 📈. Since launching in 2016, we have grown to over 5,000+ customers globally, including brands like Loom, Robinhood, and Gusto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Lattice is committed to equal treatment and opportunity in all aspects of recruitment, selection, and employment without regard to gender, race, religion, national origin, ethnicity, disability, gender identity/expression, sexual orientation, veteran or military status, or any other category protected under the law. Lattice is an equal opportunity employer; committed to a community of inclusion, and an environment free from discrimination, harassment, and retaliation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
