&lt;li&gt;Experience in multi-product B2B SaaS, or with HR/people-data or other sensitive-data workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have strong experience with integrations, APIs, or platform products, even if you don’t meet every preferred qualification, we encourage you to apply. We’re looking for strong product thinkers with deep technical fluency, not perfect resumes.&lt;/p&gt;
