&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an experienced Senior Manager, Infrastructure and Support to lead Lattice&#39;s Corporate IT infrastructure, identity, endpoint, office technology, SaaS administration, and employee support operations. This leader will create a more mature operating model for IT support while driving secure automation, identity governance, and AI productivity-tool enablement.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The person in this role will manage a distributed team of IT engineers and support specialists and will be accountable for service quality, escalation management, roadmap execution, access and endpoint hygiene, vendor coordination, and cross-functional delivery with Security, People, Workplace, Business Systems, and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technology roadmap for Corporate IT Infrastructure and Support across identity, endpoint, office technology, SaaS administration, support operations, and AI productivity-tool governance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the operating model for a distributed IT team, including prioritization, escalation paths, service metrics, runbooks, change control, and support-quality expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive MFA and identity modernization programs, including Okta Verify, Device Trust, Duo/Beyond Identity retirement, Okta environment audit, and least-privilege remediation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead endpoint-management and device-compliance evolution, including Jamf-to-Iru migration, Mac hardware refresh planning, policy enforcement, and lifecycle automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with People/HRIS and Business Systems to strengthen onboarding, offboarding, role-based access, Rippling-to-Okta workflows, SCIM provisioning, and downstream SaaS lifecycle automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own employee-support readiness for SF/NY office IT infrastructure, remote-work support, AV/networking coordination, and production support escalations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish safe administration and support patterns for AI productivity tools such as ChatGPT, Claude/CoWork, Console, Cursor, and related access workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security and Compliance to improve auditability, access reviews, device posture, production change review, and evidence quality for IT-controlled systems.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use automation and AI responsibly to improve ticket triage, knowledge management, incident summaries, migration tracking, and support communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide senior escalation support for complex IT, identity, endpoint, and SaaS incidents while coaching the team toward durable fixes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As the direct manager of the team, partner with the People team to manage hiring, onboarding, professional development, performance feedback, promotions, terminations, disciplinary procedures, and compensation actions to maintain a skilled technical and service-oriented staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear expectations, assign ownership, delegate effectively, evaluate team activities, and maintain a consistent operating cadence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide ongoing performance feedback, goal setting, coaching, and development plans for staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan for future staffing, coverage, and capability needs as the infrastructure/support function matures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a strong documentation culture across runbooks, support playbooks, migration plans, system ownership, and escalation procedures&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage vendor/platform evaluations and renewals in partnership with Procurement, Finance, Legal, Security, and business owners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate technical risks and operational tradeoffs into clear recommendations for leaders and cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring to the Table&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least 8 years of experience in corporate IT, infrastructure, workplace technology, identity/access management, endpoint management, or enterprise SaaS administration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of people-management experience leading IT engineering, infrastructure, support, or workplace technology teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on or architectural depth with Okta/IAM, SSO, SAML/OIDC, SCIM, MFA, device trust, groups, policies, and SaaS provisioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with endpoint management and compliance tooling such as Jamf, Iru, MDM platforms, Mac fleet management, device lifecycle, and hardware refresh planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable IT support operations, including escalation management, service metrics, runbooks, incident response, and customer-oriented employee support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to partner across Security, Compliance, People/HRIS, Workplace, Procurement, Finance, Legal, Engineering, Business Systems, and business leaders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Practical automation experience using APIs, scripting, Okta Workflows, Workato, or similar tools to reduce manual operational work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound judgment around access governance, least privilege, sensitive employee data, audit readiness, and production change control&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Desired technology experience: Okta, Okta Verify, Google Workspace, Slack, Zoom, Jamf/Iru or similar MDM, Rippling, Lumos/IGA, Jira/JSM, Workato/Okta Workflows, ChatGPT, Claude/CoWork, Console, Cursor, and SaaS admin tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience administering or governing AI-enabled productivity tools and applying AI to improve IT operations responsibly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to evaluate vendors and guide build-vs-buy decisions with clear business, risk, cost, and operational tradeoffs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills with the ability to explain technical risk and operational decisions to non-technical stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience in high-growth SaaS, distributed workforces, or complex enterprise technology environments preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
